# Canonical C formatting for AegisDB, enforced in CI (see docs/conventions.md).
# LLVM base — attach braces, right-aligned pointers (`char *p`), K&R spacing —
# with the project's long-standing 4-space indent and 80-column width.
# Comment reflowing is off so existing `/* */` comments aren't re-wrapped.
---
Language: Cpp
BasedOnStyle: LLVM
IndentWidth: 4
TabWidth: 4
UseTab: Never
ColumnLimit: 80
ReflowComments: false
...
